  {
   "id": "elypse-182076@major-2023-03-28",
   "gameId": "elypse-182076",
   "displayName": "Update & News concerning Elypse development.",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-28T14:35:03.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey there,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So we figured that it could be interesting to keep you posted about where we are at concerning Elypse development.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Every feature of the game are complete and we are now working on polishing the game and optimizing it. As performance was an issue on the demo.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Among the many polishes we are doing to Elypse, we are working on some features that have been reported by you, players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We tweaked the jump to have a better fit to the gamefeel and feedbacks, and last but not least we are implementing a camera panning for release.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other than that we are starting to talk about release with our publishers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will, of course, keep you posted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hot Chili Games.: website: twitter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
